  "label": "Ilhan Omar",
  "description": "Ilhan Omar is a Somali-American politician and the first Somali-American woman elected to the U.S. Congress, representing Minnesota. She is a member of the Democratic Party and has been a vocal advocate for progressive policies, including immigration reform and racial justice. The meme falsely accuses her of forgetting the 9/11 attacks, which is a baseless and politically motivated attack intended to discredit her. Her identity as a Muslim woman of African descent is central to the meme's harmful intent.",
